{"id":35403,"date":"2021-02-11T11:00:19","date_gmt":"2021-02-11T16:00:19","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/?p=35403"},"modified":"2021-02-10T12:50:02","modified_gmt":"2021-02-10T17:50:02","slug":"dead-by-daylight-un-nouveau-tome-darchives-divergence-et-autres-nouveautes","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/dead-by-daylight-un-nouveau-tome-darchives-divergence-et-autres-nouveautes\/","title":{"rendered":"Dead by Daylight : un nouveau tome d&rsquo;Archives : Divergence, et autres nouveaut\u00e9s"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><strong>Il s&rsquo;en passe des choses chez Behaviour qui nous annonce plusieurs nouveaut\u00e9s pour <a href=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/sujet\/dead-by-daylight\/\">Dead by Daylight<\/a>! Un nouveau tome intitul\u00e9 Divergence sera bient\u00f4t disponible dans les Archives, ainsi qu&rsquo;un nouveau d\u00e9fi des Glyphes, une nouvelle collection la Ru\u00e9e Dor\u00e9e dans la boutique et la refonte graphique de The Realm Beyond.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h5><em>Images gracieuset\u00e9 de Behaviour<\/em><\/h5>\n<div class=\"shortcode shortcode--youtube\"><div class=\"player player--youtube player--shortcode\"><div class=\"player__content\" style=\"\"><iframe src=\"\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/5WbM1Q25d-g?rel=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<h3>\u00c0 LIRE AUSSI :\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/dead-by-daylight-sur-switch-une-experience-solide\/\">Dead by Daylight sur Switch : une exp\u00e9rience solide<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><em>Tous les d\u00e9tails dans le communiqu\u00e9 de Behaviour :<\/em><\/p>\n<h2><span data-contrast=\"none\">Un nouveau Tome<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">: DIVERGENCE\u00a0<\/span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:120,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">\u00a0<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\">Ce Tome explore le paradoxe de la vie \u2013 les contradictions des versions pass\u00e9es, pr\u00e9sentes et futures de qui nous sommes. Les joueurs pourront\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">ainsi\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">acc\u00e9der aux souvenirs de\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">Yui<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">Kimura, L\u2019infirmi\u00e8re et l\u2019Observateur<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\">Yui<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">est aux prises avec un cauchemar r\u00e9current dans lequel elle est confront\u00e9e \u00e0 toutes\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">les versions d\u2019elle-m\u00eame qui auraient pu se concr\u00e9tiser\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">si ses choix de vie avaient \u00e9t\u00e9 diff\u00e9rents.\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">Une de ces versions explore ce qu\u2019il s<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">e<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">rait advenu si elle n\u2019avait jamais\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">quitt\u00e9\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">Hida<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u00a0pour poursuivre ses r\u00eaves. Une autre version\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">examine la vie qu\u2019elle aurait pu avoir en chois<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">is<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">sant un emploi stable<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">. D\u2019autres versions, beaucoup plus sombres et funestes<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u00a0sont \u00e9galement examin\u00e9es<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">,\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">dans lesquelles<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u00a0elle d\u00e9cide de r<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u00e9<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">gler ses comptes \u00e0 sa fa\u00e7on, pr\u00e9f\u00e9rant se v<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">e<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">ng<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">er de son agresseur plut\u00f4t que de le\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">livrer \u00e0 la police.\u00a0<\/span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:120,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\">Ce Tome\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u00e9tudie l\u2019effet papillon ou ce que l\u2019Observateur appelle l\u2019effet avalanche<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">; c\u2019est-\u00e0-dire lorsqu\u2019<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u00a0un choix, qui peut para\u00eetre insignifiant<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">,<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">change compl\u00e8tement le portrait de tout ce que l\u2019on peut\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">tenir<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u00a0pour acquis.\u00a0<\/span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:120,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Comme toujours, les joueurs pourront se procurer des tenues<\/span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">\u00a0via la branche gratuite de la Faille ainsi que des tenues exclusives pour L\u2019Infirmi\u00e8<\/span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">r<\/span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">e,\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Yui<\/span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">, l\u2019<\/span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Oni<\/span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">, Claudette et Felix via les r\u00e9compenses premium.\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">\u00a0<\/span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:120,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"shortcode shortcode--youtube\"><div class=\"player player--youtube player--shortcode\"><div class=\"player__content\" style=\"\"><iframe src=\"\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/J6tQ8dfeD5A?rel=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<h2><span data-contrast=\"none\">Nouveau d\u00e9fi: le d\u00e9fi des glyphes\u00a0<\/span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:120,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">\u00a0<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\">Introduits en t<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">ant<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u00a0que nouveaux d\u00e9fis au sein de ce Tome et disponible<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">s<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u00a0via la toile d\u2019<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">Oris<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">,\u00a0<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">les d\u00e9fis des glyphes permettent aux joueurs, qu\u2019ils personnifie<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">nt<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u00a0un Tueur ou un Survivant, de g\u00e9n\u00e9rer de nouveaux items interactifs au sein de leurs joutes.<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">\u00a0Ceci n\u2019est qu\u2019un avant<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">&#8211;<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">go\u00fbt des fa\u00e7ons dont l\u2019Observateur int<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">e<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">ragira avec les personnages durant les \u00e9preuve<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">s<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">. Restez \u00e0 l\u2019aff\u00fbt!<\/span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:120,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span data-contrast=\"none\">N<\/span><span data-contrast=\"none\">ouvelle collection dans la boutique du jeu<\/span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:120,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">\u00a0<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.c